WEBVTT

00:08.862 --> 00:09.862
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.965 --> 00:12.000
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.103 --> 00:13.241
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.344 --> 00:14.482
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.586 --> 00:17.034
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:17.137 --> 00:20.206
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.310 --> 00:21.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:21.517 --> 00:23.689
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:23.793 --> 00:25.137
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:25.241 --> 00:28.344
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:28.448 --> 00:29.724
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:29.827 --> 00:32.344
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:32.448 --> 00:34.137
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:34.241 --> 00:36.206
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.310 --> 00:39.206
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.310 --> 00:40.206
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.310 --> 00:42.758
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:45.103 --> 00:48.758
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:48.862 --> 00:52.103
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:01.379 --> 01:07.103
Ah, observe the majesty
of the mighty iceberg.
啊，观察陛下
巨大的冰山。

01:07.206 --> 01:08.413
This frozen giant,
这个冰冻的巨人，

01:08.517 --> 01:12.379
normally found
floating in polar regions,
通常发现
漂浮在极地地区，

01:12.482 --> 01:14.896
can sometimes stray
into warmer waters,
有时会迷失
进入温暖的水域，

01:15.000 --> 01:16.655
causing dramatic changes
in climate
造成巨大的变化
在气候中

01:16.758 --> 01:19.758
for tropical undersea life.
适合热带海底生物。

01:21.344 --> 01:26.379
Yes, it seems Old Man Winter
paid us a visit late last night,
是的，看来是冬天老人
昨晚深夜来拜访我们，

01:26.482 --> 01:28.827
and he brought with him
not a pillow or a sheet
他带来了
不是枕头或床单

01:28.931 --> 01:32.620
but a blanket...
a blanket of snow!
但一条毯子...
一片雪！

01:32.724 --> 01:36.137
Yes, from Jellyfish Fields...
是的，来自水母田……

01:36.241 --> 01:37.896
to residential abodes...
到住宅区...

01:38.000 --> 01:39.758
to bustling downtown...
到繁华的市中心...

01:39.862 --> 01:42.241
it's nothing
but the white stuff.
没什么
但白色的东西。

01:42.344 --> 01:43.965
Whoopee!
哎哟！

01:44.068 --> 01:47.103
And local residents
are taking notice.
还有当地居民
正在注意。

01:56.241 --> 01:58.000
Hmm...
唔...

02:04.827 --> 02:06.034
Hey!
嘿！

02:06.965 --> 02:08.137
What's this?
这是什么？

02:08.241 --> 02:11.448
Drops of rain
frozen into ice crystals?
雨滴
冻结成冰晶？

02:11.551 --> 02:16.482
I shall harness their energy
and rule the world!
我将利用他们的能量
并统治世界！

02:17.758 --> 02:18.620
Aah... oh! Stop!
啊啊……哦！停止！

02:18.724 --> 02:23.344
I wish to rule you!
我想统治你！

02:23.931 --> 02:25.517
Snow angel!
雪天使！

02:29.827 --> 02:31.172
Oh...
哦...

02:31.275 --> 02:32.275
Hey!
嘿！

02:34.310 --> 02:35.517
Thanks a lot, SpongeBob!
非常感谢，海绵宝宝！

02:35.620 --> 02:38.241
While you were just
standing there whistling,
当你刚刚
站在那里吹口哨

02:38.344 --> 02:39.586
someone threw a snowball at me!
有人向我扔雪球！

02:39.689 --> 02:41.862
Oh, really, Patrick?
哦，真的吗，帕特里克？

02:41.965 --> 02:45.206
Did the snowball look like this?
雪球是这样的吗？

02:45.724 --> 02:46.724
Yeah.
是的。

02:47.655 --> 02:49.172
This is serious, SpongeBob.
这很严重，海绵宝宝。

02:49.275 --> 02:50.275
Someone's after me.
有人在追我。

02:50.310 --> 02:52.206
I think I better leave town.
我想我最好离开这座城市。

02:52.310 --> 02:53.344
Patrick, I threw it.
帕特里克，是我扔的。

02:53.448 --> 02:55.517
We're having a snowball fight.
我们正在打雪仗。

02:55.620 --> 02:56.758
Don't you get it?
你不明白吗？

02:56.862 --> 02:57.689
Snowball fight?
打雪仗？

02:57.793 --> 03:00.000
I want to play!
I want to play!
我想玩！
我想玩！

03:00.103 --> 03:02.965
Well, first,
you have to make a snowball.
嗯，首先，
你必须做一个雪球。

03:03.068 --> 03:03.862
Oh, yeah! A snowball.
哦，是啊！一个雪球。

03:03.965 --> 03:07.655
Ooh, this is going to be great!
哦，这会很棒的！

03:07.758 --> 03:09.724
Huh?
啊？

03:10.689 --> 03:12.310
Wha...?
世界卫生大会...？

03:14.413 --> 03:16.310
Aw...!
噢...！

03:16.413 --> 03:17.275
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

03:17.379 --> 03:18.458
Can you help me make a snowball?
你能帮我堆雪球吗？

03:18.482 --> 03:20.103
Sure, pal.
当然，朋友。

03:22.034 --> 03:23.551
Thanks, buddy.
谢谢，伙计。

03:23.896 --> 03:24.620
Patrick!
帕特里克！

03:24.724 --> 03:25.517
How could you?!
你怎么可以？！

03:25.620 --> 03:28.551
It's a snowball fight, remember?
这是一场打雪仗，记得吗？

03:28.655 --> 03:30.103
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

03:36.000 --> 03:37.758
Ah, yes...
啊，是的...

03:37.862 --> 03:39.241
Warm fire, cozy slippers,
温暖的炉火，舒适的拖鞋，

03:39.344 --> 03:44.275
and a piping hot cup of tea
with a lemon wedge.
和一杯滚烫的茶
配柠檬角。

03:44.379 --> 03:46.000
Aah!
啊啊！

03:46.103 --> 03:48.448
Why do I even bother?
为什么我还要打扰？

03:54.724 --> 03:56.862
Would you two
你们两个愿意吗

03:56.965 --> 03:58.344
please keep it down?!
请小声点好吗？！

03:58.448 --> 04:01.862
Squidward! You're just in time
to enlist in my army!
章鱼哥！你来得正是时候
加入我的军队！

04:01.965 --> 04:06.000
Join me and together
we'll defeat the Pink Menace!
加入我并一起
我们会打败粉红威胁！

04:06.103 --> 04:06.931
That's me!
这就是我！

04:07.034 --> 04:08.482
You start off as a buck private,
你一开始是一名普通二等兵，

04:08.586 --> 04:10.867
but with hard work, perhaps
you can rise through the ranks
但通过努力，也许
你可以晋升

04:10.965 --> 04:13.103
and become a regular private!
并成为一名普通私人！

04:13.206 --> 04:15.620
Thanks, but no, thanks,
Major Stupidity.
谢谢，但是不，谢谢，
主要的愚蠢。

04:15.724 --> 04:20.275
You and General Nonsense
over there will have
to fight without me.
你和一般的废话
那边会有
没有我的情况下战斗。

04:21.620 --> 04:22.758
Got 'em both.
两个都得到了。

04:26.793 --> 04:27.620
Patrick, you fool!
帕特里克，你这个傻瓜！

04:27.724 --> 04:29.551
This was over before it started!
这一切还没开始就已经结束了！

04:29.655 --> 04:33.517
I will now consider your
unconditional surren...
我现在将考虑您的
无条件投降...

04:33.620 --> 04:34.896
der.
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。
der。

04:37.517 --> 04:42.379
So, that's how he wants it
to go down.
所以，这就是他想要的
下去。

04:48.862 --> 04:50.379
Ooh.
哦。

04:53.310 --> 04:55.551
Ha! You missed me!
哈!你想念我了！

05:15.655 --> 05:17.068
Ooh.
哦。

05:26.172 --> 05:30.551
Score one for the boys
back home!
男子队得一分
回家吧！

05:32.724 --> 05:34.275
Yes? Oh, Patrick.
是的？哦，帕特里克。

05:34.379 --> 05:36.241
What an unpleasant surprise.
多么令人不愉快的惊喜啊。

05:36.344 --> 05:40.724
Oh, boy, nothing like
a game of charades.
哦，男孩，没有什么比
猜谜游戏

05:44.137 --> 05:47.068
I was trying to tell you
that I was choking on snow,
我试图告诉你
我被雪噎住了

05:47.172 --> 05:49.413
but the snow melted
and turned into water
但雪融化了
并变成了水

05:49.517 --> 05:52.517
and I drank all the water;
now I'm better.
我把水都喝光了；
现在我好多了。

05:52.620 --> 05:53.793
Fascinating.
迷人。

05:53.896 --> 05:54.965
Now, where was I?
现在，我在哪里？

05:56.620 --> 05:57.310
What?
什么？

05:57.413 --> 05:58.482
Can I use your bathroom?
我可以使用你的浴室吗？

05:58.586 --> 06:00.793
Patrick, go use
your own bathroom.
帕特里克，去使用
你自己的浴室。

06:00.896 --> 06:01.586
I won't make it.
Please?
我不会成功的。
请？

06:01.689 --> 06:03.482
No.
不。

06:03.586 --> 06:03.931
Please?
请？

06:04.034 --> 06:05.034
No.
不。

06:05.068 --> 06:05.620
Please?
请？

06:05.724 --> 06:06.275
No.
不。

06:06.379 --> 06:07.000
Please!
请！

06:07.103 --> 06:08.310
Make it quick.
快点吧。

06:08.413 --> 06:09.310
That's okay.
没关系。

06:09.413 --> 06:10.206
Aha!
啊哈！

06:10.310 --> 06:10.931
Aiding the enemy!
援助敌人！

06:11.034 --> 06:13.068
I caught you Squidward!
我抓住你了，章鱼哥！

06:13.172 --> 06:15.551
Look, SpongeBob, I was just...
听着，海绵宝宝，我只是……

06:16.000 --> 06:18.931
SpongeBob! Oh!
海绵宝宝！哦！

06:19.862 --> 06:22.103
Yay! Squidward's
on my side!
耶！章鱼哥的
在我这边！

06:22.206 --> 06:24.137
I most certainly am not!
我绝对不是！

06:24.241 --> 06:25.355
Then that means he's on my side!
那说明他是站在我这边的！

06:25.379 --> 06:29.310
No, SpongeBob, I'm not
on your side either!
不，海绵宝宝，我不是
也站在你这边！

06:29.413 --> 06:30.689
I'm on nobody's side.
我不站在任何人一边。

06:30.793 --> 06:34.275
Snowball fights are
for immature children,
打雪仗是
对于尚未成熟的孩子来说，

06:34.379 --> 06:36.620
and I will not stoop
to your level.
我不会弯腰
达到你的水平。

06:36.724 --> 06:41.793
If you two want to knock
each other's brains out
with snowballs,
如果你们两个想敲门
彼此的脑子都出来了
带着雪球，

06:41.896 --> 06:43.172
kindly leave me out of it.
请让我远离它。

06:43.275 --> 06:45.827
SpongeBob, let's go knock
each other's brains out!
海绵宝宝，我们去敲门吧
彼此的脑子都出来了！

06:45.931 --> 06:48.034
I'm ready!
我准备好了！

06:48.137 --> 06:49.551
Hmm.
唔。

06:51.000 --> 06:53.827
Okay, Patrick, it's out.
好吧，帕特里克，一切都结束了。

06:55.137 --> 06:57.379
Now, there's something
I'd actually like to see.
现在，有件事
其实我很想看看

06:57.482 --> 07:00.758
Nothing wrong with getting
a front-row seat, I suppose.
得到没有什么错
我想是前排座位。

07:01.655 --> 07:03.241
Ah.
啊。

07:03.344 --> 07:05.103
What's this?
这是什么？

07:05.206 --> 07:07.379
Wha... I... No!
什...我...不！

07:07.482 --> 07:08.827
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

07:08.931 --> 07:11.724
You're supposed to be knocking
each other's brains out!
你应该敲门
彼此的脑子都出来了！

07:11.827 --> 07:13.620
We signed a peace treaty,
Squidward.
我们签署了和平条约，
章鱼哥。

07:13.724 --> 07:15.758
You were right...
Fighting is for children.
你是对的...
打架是为了孩子。

07:15.862 --> 07:19.137
No, no, I misled you,
it's for adults, too.
不不不，我误导你了
它也适合成人。

07:19.241 --> 07:19.965
Give me that peace treaty!
把和平条约给我！

07:20.068 --> 07:21.310
There! Let the war
continue.
那里！让战争
继续。

07:21.413 --> 07:24.482
Squidward,
that wasn't
the peace treaty.
章鱼哥，
那不是
和平条约。

07:24.586 --> 07:27.620
That was a copy
of the peace treaty.
那是一个副本
和平条约。

07:27.724 --> 07:30.448
Look, you two are
giving up too easily.
瞧，你们两个是
太容易放弃。

07:30.551 --> 07:32.793
Now, Patrick,
pretend I'm SpongeBob.
现在，帕特里克，
假装我是海绵宝宝。

07:32.896 --> 07:33.931
And who am I?
而我是谁？

07:34.034 --> 07:35.965
You're Patrick.
你是帕特里克。

07:36.068 --> 07:37.344
Can I be Mr. Krabs?
我可以成为蟹老板吗？

07:37.448 --> 07:38.931
No! Wait, why?
不！等等，为什么？

07:39.034 --> 07:39.896
He's a good leader.
他是一个很好的领导者。

07:40.000 --> 07:40.793
Would you butt out?!
你敢放屁吗？！

07:40.896 --> 07:42.896
Hey, you can't talk
to Mr. Krabs
嘿，你不能说话
致蟹老板

07:43.000 --> 07:43.758
like that, Squidward!
就这样，章鱼哥！

07:43.862 --> 07:46.482
I'm SpongeBob! You're Patrick!
我是海绵宝宝！你是帕特里克！

07:48.172 --> 07:50.862
Now, what are you going to do?
现在，你要做什么？

07:52.413 --> 07:55.551
Patrick, why didn't
you hit SpongeBob?
帕特里克，为什么不呢？
你打海绵宝宝了吗？

07:55.655 --> 07:56.551
You said you were SpongeBob.
你说你是海绵宝宝。

07:56.655 --> 07:59.482
It's true!
这是真的！

07:59.586 --> 08:00.896
Now, get back to work!
现在，回去工作吧！

08:02.241 --> 08:04.689
Oh, boy. All right,
I can see where
this is going.
哦，男孩。好吧，
我可以看到哪里
这正在发生。

08:04.793 --> 08:06.482
Let's just say
for all intents and purposes
就说吧
出于所有意图和目的

08:06.586 --> 08:11.275
that I, Squidward, am now
part of this war. Now...
我，章鱼哥，现在
这场战争的一部分。现在...

08:11.379 --> 08:13.068
Where's your fort?
你的堡垒在哪里？

08:13.172 --> 08:14.517
I don't have one, okay? Now...
我没有，可以吗？现在...

08:14.620 --> 08:16.034
You need a fort, Squidward.
你需要一座堡垒，章鱼哥。

08:16.137 --> 08:17.177
Forts win wars, Squidward.
堡垒赢得战争，章鱼哥。

08:18.689 --> 08:19.517
Okay, fine!
You want a fort?
好吧，好吧！
你想要一座堡垒吗？

08:19.620 --> 08:22.034
There, there's
your fort! Now...
那里，那里有
你的堡垒！现在...

08:22.137 --> 08:23.551
That fort's too small.
那个堡垒太小了。

08:23.655 --> 08:24.689
It's okay, Patrick.
没关系，帕特里克。

08:24.793 --> 08:27.482
It's just a demonstration.
Now...
这只是一个演示。
现在...

08:27.586 --> 08:28.586
He's right, Squidward.
他是对的，章鱼哥。

08:28.620 --> 08:30.482
That thing would
never protect you.
那东西会
永远不会保护你。

08:30.586 --> 08:31.586
It's downright puny.
实在是太微不足道了。

08:31.655 --> 08:33.586
Trust me, it's fine!
相信我，没问题！

08:34.241 --> 08:36.344
See? It is too small.
看？它太小了。

08:36.448 --> 08:37.620
Not if I crouch down!
如果我蹲下来就不会！

08:37.724 --> 08:39.241
You didn't let me crouch down!
你不让我蹲下！

08:39.344 --> 08:41.793
See? Down here,
I am perfectly...
看？下面，
我完全...

08:41.896 --> 08:43.482
Exposed.
裸露。

08:43.586 --> 08:46.310
Would you two please...
请你们两个...

08:46.413 --> 08:48.000
stop throwing...
别扔了...

08:48.103 --> 08:49.586
snowballs?!
雪球？！

08:56.448 --> 08:58.758
Squidward returned fire!
章鱼哥还击！

08:58.862 --> 08:59.965
Then it's war!
然后就是战争了！

09:00.068 --> 09:00.965
No, no, wait, wait.
不，不，等等，等等。

09:01.068 --> 09:03.862
I was just giving
a demonstration!
我只是在给予
示威！

09:13.103 --> 09:14.241
All right, that's it!
好吧，就是这样！

09:14.344 --> 09:15.551
You guys asked for it!
你们自找的！

09:18.310 --> 09:21.000
I got him! Ha! I got him.
我抓到他了！哈!我抓住了他。

09:22.241 --> 09:23.862
In your face, SpongeBob!
在你面前，海绵宝宝！

09:25.413 --> 09:30.344
That was actually
kind of... exciting!
那实际上是
有点……令人兴奋！

09:30.448 --> 09:34.103
Why, I've never felt so alive!
为什么，我从来没有感觉如此充满活力！

09:35.241 --> 09:37.068
He got you good, SpongeBob!
他对你很好，海绵宝宝！

09:37.172 --> 09:38.068
Ooh!
哦！

09:38.172 --> 09:39.448
Take cover!
掩护！

09:39.551 --> 09:42.965
Take that! I got you!
拿那个！我接到你了！

09:43.068 --> 09:44.965
Yeah, oh, I got you!
是的，哦，我找到你了！

09:45.068 --> 09:45.758
Oh, take that!
哦，拿那个！

09:45.862 --> 09:47.758
Whoa, I got you that time!
哇哦，那一次我抓住了你！

09:47.862 --> 09:50.620
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

09:52.965 --> 09:54.862
Incoming!
来袭！

09:54.965 --> 09:56.827
Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

09:56.931 --> 09:59.068
Yes, Patrick?
是的，帕特里克？

09:59.172 --> 10:01.517
I think Squidward's
taking this really seriously.
我觉得是章鱼哥
非常认真地对待这件事。

10:01.620 --> 10:03.551
That last one had
his clarinet in it!
最后一个有
他的单簧管在里面！

10:03.655 --> 10:06.034
Hmm, looks like
it's time for Plan B.
嗯，看起来像
是时候实施 B 计划了。

10:17.034 --> 10:18.896
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

10:19.000 --> 10:21.310
The snowballs
have stopped falling.
雪球
已经停止下降。

10:21.413 --> 10:25.620
I better take advantage
of this momentary cease-fire.
我最好好好利用
暂时的停火。

10:25.724 --> 10:27.137
What?! My left flank is exposed!
什么？！我的左胁暴露了！

10:27.241 --> 10:30.275
That bloated starfish is
going to run right through me!
那个浮肿的海星是
会直接穿过我的身体！

10:30.379 --> 10:32.965
I'll just fix that right now.
我现在就解决这个问题。

10:35.620 --> 10:40.172
Wait, that makes my north wall
a weak spot. Ha!
等等，这就是我的北墙
一个弱点。哈!

10:40.275 --> 10:42.206
Here we go. Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.
开始了。嗯嗯，嗯嗯。

10:42.310 --> 10:43.482
Oh, oh, oh!
哦，哦，哦！

10:43.586 --> 10:45.217
But if they attack
from the rear, I'm a goner.
但如果他们攻击
从后面看，我已经完蛋了。

10:45.241 --> 10:48.206
There. Ha-ha!
那里。哈哈！

10:48.310 --> 10:51.827
But what about the possibility
of an aerial attack?
但有什么可能性
空袭？

10:54.379 --> 10:58.000
I guess that ought to do it.
我想应该可以做到。

10:59.724 --> 11:03.103
Fort Squidward is now
all but impenetrable!
章鱼堡现在是
几乎是坚不可摧的！

11:06.827 --> 11:10.586
Now, where are those fools?
现在，那些傻瓜在哪里？

11:11.827 --> 11:13.147
Ha! The first shot
has been fired!
哈!第一枪
已被解雇！

11:15.137 --> 11:16.310
Take this, Patrick!
拿着这个，帕特里克！

11:17.551 --> 11:19.896
Taste my frozen fury!
尝尝我冰冻的愤怒吧！

11:20.000 --> 11:22.172
Victory is mine!
胜利是我的！

11:25.275 --> 11:26.379
Whee!
哎哟！

11:26.482 --> 11:27.724
I got you now!
我现在找到你了！

11:30.517 --> 11:32.896
Did you hear something, Patrick?
你听到什么了吗，帕特里克？

11:33.000 --> 11:34.000
Nope.
没有。

11:46.965 --> 11:49.827
Ah, a yard sale.
啊，庭院旧货出售。

11:49.931 --> 11:51.275
You know the old saying:
你知道那句老话：

11:51.379 --> 11:54.482
"One man's trash is
another man's treasure."
“一个人的垃圾是
另一个人的宝藏。”

11:55.517 --> 11:57.931
Disposable?!
一次性的？！

11:58.034 --> 11:59.551
Phooey.
噗。

12:00.241 --> 12:04.724
For Mr. Krabs,
all trash is treasure.
对于蟹老板来说，
所有的垃圾都是宝藏。

12:10.862 --> 12:14.793
Open for business.
开门营业。

12:15.206 --> 12:16.655
See anything you like?
看看有什么你喜欢的吗？

12:16.758 --> 12:19.034
Give you $1.50
for this umbrella.
给你 1.50 美元
为了这把伞。

12:19.137 --> 12:19.724
$1.50 for that?!
1.50 美元？！

12:19.827 --> 12:21.931
But it's an antique!
但这是古董！

12:22.034 --> 12:24.000
It belonged to a queen.
它属于一位女王。

12:24.103 --> 12:25.172
Ten bucks.
十块钱。

12:25.275 --> 12:26.965
Ten bucks?!
十块钱？！

12:27.068 --> 12:27.827
It's full of holes!
浑身都是坑啊！

12:27.931 --> 12:30.241
It was the queen of Switzerland.
那是瑞士女王。

12:30.344 --> 12:32.448
A queen, you say? That's...
你说女王？那是...

12:32.551 --> 12:36.172
Wait a second,
they don't have a queen.
等一下，
他们没有女王。

12:36.275 --> 12:38.448
Okay,
Mr. Bargain Hunter.
好吧，
讨价还价猎人先生。

12:38.551 --> 12:39.862
Five bucks.
五块钱。

12:39.965 --> 12:41.068
Deal!
交易！

12:42.448 --> 12:46.482
Ah, the sweet smell
of an all-day sucker.
啊，甜甜的味道
一个整天傻瓜的人。

12:47.758 --> 12:50.137
They taste even better.
它们味道更好。

12:50.241 --> 12:51.241
Hi, Mr. Krabs.
嗨，蟹老板。

12:51.310 --> 12:53.137
What you doing?
你在做什么？

12:53.965 --> 12:56.275
I'm having an antique sale.
我正在举办一场古董拍卖会。

12:56.379 --> 12:57.482
Have a look around.
看看周围。

12:57.586 --> 13:00.103
Hey, Patrick,
look at this thing.
嘿，帕特里克，
看看这个东西。

13:00.206 --> 13:01.620
Pretty cool, huh?
很酷吧？

13:01.724 --> 13:04.241
That looks like
the toilet plunger
I threw out yesterday.
看起来像
马桶柱塞
我昨天扔了。

13:04.344 --> 13:06.275
That ain't no toilet plunger.
那不是厕所柱塞。

13:06.379 --> 13:07.793
This here's an antique!
这是古董！

13:07.896 --> 13:13.448
It, uh... um... uh...
a 17th-century soup ladle, see?
它，呃……呃……呃……
17世纪的汤勺，看到了吗？

13:13.551 --> 13:15.482
Man, was I using mine wrong.
伙计，我是不是用错了。

13:15.586 --> 13:17.241
How much?
多少？

13:17.344 --> 13:18.448
Five bucks.
五块钱。

13:18.965 --> 13:21.413
I've only got seven.
我只有七个。

13:21.517 --> 13:22.655
Deal!
交易！

13:22.758 --> 13:26.724
Patrick Star,
you are one smart shopper.
帕特里克·斯塔,
您是一位聪明的购物者。

13:28.310 --> 13:32.275
Wow! Look at this neat-o
soda-drinking hat.
哇！看看这个整洁的o
喝苏打水的帽子。

13:32.379 --> 13:37.758
Oh! It must've belonged to
someone who was number one.
哦！它一定是属于
排名第一的人。

13:37.862 --> 13:40.344
There's only been
a handful of number ones
只曾有过
少数几个数字

13:40.448 --> 13:41.562
in the entire history
of forever.
在整个历史上
的永远。

13:41.586 --> 13:45.862
That's right, SpongeBob,
and you're one of 'em.
没错，海绵宝宝，
而你就是其中之一。

13:45.965 --> 13:47.034
Really?
真的吗？

13:47.137 --> 13:49.172
This hat says
"Hey, I'm number one
这顶帽子说
“嘿，我是第一名

13:49.275 --> 13:52.000
and I let gravity
do my drinking."
我让重力
帮我喝酒。”

13:52.103 --> 13:54.172
This hat was made for you, boy.
这顶帽子是为你量身定做的，孩子。

13:54.275 --> 13:57.000
You were born to wear this hat!
你生来就该戴这顶帽子！

13:57.103 --> 13:59.103
Eee... ooh...!
哎呀……噢……！

13:59.206 --> 14:00.448
A perfect fit, eh, son?
完美契合，嗯，儿子？

14:00.551 --> 14:02.000
Oh, thank you,
Mr. Krabs!
哦，谢谢你，
蟹老板！

14:02.103 --> 14:03.793
Thank you for
bringing us together!
谢谢你
让我们走到一起！

14:03.896 --> 14:06.689
How can I ever repay you?
我该如何报答你呢？

14:06.793 --> 14:08.793
With ten dollars.
带着十块钱。

14:10.206 --> 14:10.965
All I have is five.
我只有五个。

14:11.068 --> 14:14.413
Well, I guess it's no deal.
嗯，我想这没什么好说的。

14:14.517 --> 14:15.517
I'll be right back.
我马上回来。

14:21.551 --> 14:22.655
Ah!
啊!

14:23.379 --> 14:24.424
Mr. Krabs,
I found 68 cents.
蟹老板先生，
我找到了 68 美分。

14:24.448 --> 14:28.310
But maybe you could
take the other $4.32
但也许你可以
剩下的 4.32 美元

14:28.413 --> 14:29.724
out of my paycheck.
从我的薪水中扣除。

14:29.827 --> 14:30.827
What do you say?
你怎么说？

14:30.896 --> 14:33.793
Well... I don't know...
嗯...我不知道...

14:33.896 --> 14:35.000
Uh... okay!
呃……好吧！

14:35.103 --> 14:38.931
But only 'cause you look
so dashing in that hat.
但只是因为你看起来
戴上那顶帽子是如此潇洒。

14:39.034 --> 14:40.793
Thanks, Mr. Krabs!
谢谢蟹老板！

14:40.896 --> 14:42.206
Don't mention it, boys!
别提了，孩子们！

14:43.896 --> 14:45.448
What a couple of rubes.
真是一对乡巴佬。

14:45.551 --> 14:46.344
Excuse me, sir, but are you
对不起，先生，您是吗？

14:46.448 --> 14:49.000
the purveyor
of this curio stand?
供应商
这个古玩摊？

14:49.103 --> 14:49.862
Yes, I am.
我是。

14:49.965 --> 14:51.044
I understand you're selling
我知道你在卖

14:51.068 --> 14:53.827
this rare novelty drink hat.
这顶罕见的新奇饮料帽。

14:53.931 --> 14:55.206
Fresh out.
新鲜出炉。

14:55.310 --> 14:56.413
Let me explain.
让我解释一下。

14:56.517 --> 15:00.034
I'm prepared to give you
$500 for that drink hat.
我准备给你
那顶饮料帽 500 美元。

15:00.137 --> 15:02.689
Fi-fi-fi-fi-fi...
菲菲菲菲菲菲...

15:02.793 --> 15:03.793
Not so fast.
没那么快。

15:03.862 --> 15:05.965
I'll give you $1,000
for such a hat.
我给你 1,000 美元
对于这样一顶帽子。

15:09.413 --> 15:10.413
I'll give you
我给你

15:10.517 --> 15:13.241
$100,000 in cash for said hat.
购买这顶帽子需要 10 万美元现金。

15:15.586 --> 15:20.379
Sir, I'll give you
a million dollars for that hat!
先生，我给你
那顶帽子一百万美元！

15:21.896 --> 15:25.344
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

15:27.482 --> 15:30.965
There he is
with me million-dollar hat.
他在那里
和我一起价值百万美元的帽子。

15:31.068 --> 15:32.068
I got to get it back
我得把它拿回来

15:32.172 --> 15:33.896
before he finds out
how much it's worth.
在他发现之前
它值多少钱。

15:34.000 --> 15:36.896
Ah! My bubble production
has increased twofold.
啊! My bubble production
has increased twofold.

15:37.000 --> 15:39.310
Thanks to you, Hatty.
谢谢你，哈蒂。

15:39.413 --> 15:40.482
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

15:40.586 --> 15:42.551
Mr. K! How's the antique biz
treating you?
K先生！古董生意怎么样
治疗你？

15:42.655 --> 15:43.724
Never mind that.
Listen...
没关系。
听...

15:43.827 --> 15:46.172
I didn't want to say this
in front of Patrick.
我本来不想说这个
在帕特里克面前。

15:46.275 --> 15:48.965
That hat makes you look
like a girl.
那顶帽子让你看起来
像个女孩。

15:49.068 --> 15:50.862
Am I a pretty girl?
我是一个漂亮的女孩吗？

15:50.965 --> 15:53.034
Oh, well, um...
哦，好吧，嗯...

15:53.137 --> 15:54.448
You're...
you're beautiful.
你是...
你很漂亮。

15:55.896 --> 15:56.896
Uh... heh-heh.
呃……呵呵。

15:57.896 --> 15:59.827
All right, now give
me the hat back.
好吧，现在给
我把帽子还回来。

15:59.931 --> 16:02.344
But, Mr. Krabs,
you said it yourself...
但是，蟹老板，
你自己说的...

16:02.448 --> 16:03.206
I was born to wear this hat.
我生来就是为了戴这顶帽子的。

16:03.310 --> 16:05.620
I don't want to give it back.
我不想还给它。

16:05.724 --> 16:07.379
I can't part with this hat now.
我现在离不开这顶帽子。

16:07.482 --> 16:09.482
Not after all
we've been through.
终究不是
我们已经经历过了。

16:09.586 --> 16:11.896
Thanks, Mr. Krabs!
谢谢蟹老板！

16:12.000 --> 16:13.068
I'll call you Hatty.
我就叫你哈蒂吧。

16:13.172 --> 16:15.034
And that's when you showed up.
就在那时你出现了。

16:15.137 --> 16:16.482
Aw, forget it!
哎呀，算了！

16:16.586 --> 16:19.068
And you're not beautiful either.
而且你也不漂亮。

16:19.172 --> 16:21.103
I'm not?
我不是吗？

16:25.620 --> 16:27.655
SpongeBob, just the man
I wanted to see.
海绵宝宝，就是那个男人
我想看看。

16:27.758 --> 16:29.724
Still playing with
that dumb old hat, eh?
还在玩
那顶愚蠢的老帽子，嗯？

16:29.827 --> 16:31.620
Yep.
是的。

16:31.724 --> 16:33.379
Not sick of that
boring old hat yet?
不厌倦那个
无聊的老帽子了吗？

16:33.482 --> 16:34.034
Nope.
没有。

16:34.137 --> 16:34.827
Not tired
不累

16:34.931 --> 16:36.931
of that old piece of junk?
那个旧垃圾？

16:37.034 --> 16:37.758
Uh-uh.
呃呃。

16:37.862 --> 16:39.862
Not even a teensy, tiny bit?
哪怕一点点也没有？

16:39.965 --> 16:40.379
Nope.
没有。

16:40.482 --> 16:41.517
Then I guess
那我猜

16:41.620 --> 16:42.803
you don't want to see
what's in my bag.
你不想看到
我的包里有什么。

16:42.827 --> 16:44.724
What is it?
它是什么？

16:44.827 --> 16:45.689
Novelty hats.
新奇的帽子。

16:45.793 --> 16:47.931
How about this
air-conditioned one?
这个怎么样
有空调的吗？

16:49.586 --> 16:51.068
Seems a little dangerous.
看起来有点危险。

16:51.172 --> 16:52.275
The Juicer?
榨汁机？

16:52.379 --> 16:54.413
Ooh...
哦...

16:54.517 --> 16:55.517
Foxy Grandpa?
狐狸爷爷？

16:56.965 --> 16:58.517
So, what do you say?
那么，你说呢？

16:58.620 --> 17:02.137
Your silly hat
for all these hats.
你的傻帽子
对于所有这些帽子。

17:02.241 --> 17:03.241
No deal, Mr. Krabs.
没有交易，蟹老板。

17:03.275 --> 17:04.551
I'm sticking with Hatty.
我还是坚持哈蒂。

17:04.655 --> 17:05.965
Thanks for the offer, though.
不过还是谢谢你的提议。

17:06.068 --> 17:08.758
I thought the Foxy Grandpa
would get him for sure.
我以为是狐狸爷爷
肯定会得到他的。

17:08.862 --> 17:10.689
I didn't want to have to do this
我不想这样做

17:10.793 --> 17:11.907
but he leaves me
no other option.
但他离开了我
没有其他选择。

17:11.931 --> 17:16.137
I'm going to have to
scare it off of him.
我将不得不
吓跑他。

17:26.413 --> 17:28.241
This'll scare him.
这会吓到他的。

17:34.586 --> 17:35.275
Oh, my gosh!
哦，天哪！

17:35.379 --> 17:38.827
A floating shopping list!
浮动购物清单！

17:40.758 --> 17:43.482
I'm not a shopping list...
我不是购物清单...

17:43.586 --> 17:44.586
I'm a ghost...!
我是鬼……！

17:48.241 --> 17:51.517
Now, listen, SpongeBob.
现在，听着，海绵宝宝。

17:51.620 --> 17:53.137
How do you know my name?
你怎么知道我的名字？

17:53.241 --> 17:54.275
Who are you?!
你是谁？！

17:54.379 --> 17:57.000
I am the Ghost
of Soda Drink Hats.
我是幽灵
的苏打饮料帽子。

17:57.103 --> 17:58.172
And I'm here to tell you
我来这里是为了告诉你

17:58.275 --> 18:02.517
that that soda drink hat
you possess is cursed.
那顶苏打饮料帽子
你拥有的是被诅咒的。

18:02.620 --> 18:03.862
Cursed?
被诅咒了？

18:03.965 --> 18:07.482
Yes! It once belonged
to some guy who's dead now.
是的！它曾经属于
给某个现在已经死了的人。

18:07.586 --> 18:08.379
What guy?
什么人？

18:08.482 --> 18:11.172
Uh... Smitty something.
呃... Smitty 的东西。

18:11.275 --> 18:12.103
Smitty what?
斯密蒂什么？

18:12.206 --> 18:14.172
Uh, Smitty... Werben...
呃，斯密蒂……韦本……

18:14.275 --> 18:15.275
Jaegerman... Jensen.
耶格曼……詹森。

18:15.379 --> 18:18.310
He must have been number one.
他一定是第一名。

18:18.413 --> 18:19.931
Number one in Bogeyland!
柏忌之地第一名！

18:20.034 --> 18:20.862
Now, listen...
现在，听...

18:20.965 --> 18:22.241
a curse will descend on you
诅咒将降临在你身上

18:22.344 --> 18:26.413
unless the hat is returned
to its owner immediately.
除非帽子被退回
立即交给它的主人。

18:26.517 --> 18:27.551
Immediately?
立即地？

18:27.655 --> 18:29.344
Immediately...
立即地...

18:29.448 --> 18:30.758
To its owner?
给它的主人？

18:30.862 --> 18:31.517
Yes...
是的...

18:31.620 --> 18:32.034
Right now?
现在？

18:32.137 --> 18:33.965
Yes, yes!
是的，是的！

18:34.068 --> 18:36.551
It must be returned
to its owner right now!
必须归还
现在就交给它的主人吧！

18:36.655 --> 18:37.551
Hey, Mr. Krabs.
嘿，蟹老板。

18:37.655 --> 18:38.689
Ahh! SpongeBob!
啊！海绵宝宝！

18:38.793 --> 18:40.073
Uh, uh, what are you doing here?
呃，呃，你在这里做什么？

18:40.172 --> 18:42.103
I was returning
the cursed soda drink hat
我正在回来
被诅咒的苏打饮料帽子

18:42.206 --> 18:45.068
to its original owner:
Smitty Werben Jaegerman Jensen.
致其原始所有者：
斯米蒂·沃本·耶格曼·詹森。

18:45.172 --> 18:49.172
What? There is
no Smitty Werben
Jaegerman Jensen.
什么？有
没有 Smitty Werben
耶格曼·詹森.

18:49.275 --> 18:50.172
Sure there is!
当然有！

18:50.275 --> 18:52.586
He's buried out
in Floater's Cemetery.
他被埋没了
在浮者墓地。

18:52.689 --> 18:54.344
How did? I just...
怎么样？我只是...

18:54.448 --> 18:55.655
You did... I would...
你会...我会...

18:55.758 --> 18:58.172
Give me that shovel!
把那把铲子给我！

18:58.275 --> 18:59.965
It was his hat Mr. Krabs.
这是他的帽子，蟹老板。

19:00.068 --> 19:03.724
He was number one!
他是第一！

19:12.034 --> 19:13.517
Huh?!
啊？！

19:18.034 --> 19:19.413
Ahh!
啊！

19:19.517 --> 19:21.862
Hold yourself together, Krabs.
蟹蟹们，振作起来。

19:21.965 --> 19:24.517
It's just a boneyard...
filled with bones.
这只是一个坟场...
充满了骨头。

19:26.068 --> 19:27.344
Ahh!
啊！

19:27.448 --> 19:28.137
What's that?
那是什么？

19:28.241 --> 19:30.103
It's Squidward.
这是章鱼哥。

19:30.206 --> 19:31.689
What's he doing here?
他在这里做什么？

19:33.551 --> 19:35.034
Ohh...
哦...

19:38.965 --> 19:42.137
"Here lie Squidward's
hopes and dreams."
“这里躺着章鱼哥的
希望和梦想。”

19:42.241 --> 19:44.000
What a baby. Where was I?
真是个宝贝啊。我当时在哪儿？

19:44.103 --> 19:46.344
Oh, yeah! Gotta find
Smitty Whatsajipster.
哦，是啊！一定要找到
斯密蒂·Whatsajipster。

19:46.448 --> 19:50.344
Nope... nope... no... no...
不……不……不……不……

19:50.448 --> 19:53.862
No... uh-uh... no... no...
uh-uh... nope, not there...
不……呃呃……不……不……
呃呃……不，不在那里……

19:53.965 --> 19:56.275
I've checked every headstone
in this cemetery
我检查了每一个墓碑
在这个墓地里

19:56.379 --> 19:59.379
and there's no
Smitty Wabbablabba buried here.
并且没有
斯米蒂·瓦巴拉巴 (Smitty Wabbablabba) 埋葬于此。

19:59.482 --> 20:00.862
Think, Krabs.
想一想，蟹蟹们。

20:00.965 --> 20:03.896
Maybe something SpongeBob said
will give you a clue.
也许海绵宝宝说过的话
会给你一个线索。

20:04.000 --> 20:05.724
Remember, licking doorknobs
记住，舔门把手

20:05.827 --> 20:07.655
is illegal on other planets.
在其他星球上是非法的。

20:07.758 --> 20:08.758
No, not that!
不，不是那样！

20:08.862 --> 20:09.758
You'll never guess
你绝对猜不到

20:09.862 --> 20:12.275
what I found in
my sock last night.
我发现了什么
我昨晚的袜子。

20:12.379 --> 20:13.241
Go ahead, guess!
来吧，猜猜看！

20:13.344 --> 20:14.724
No! No! No! No! No!
不！不！不！不！不！

20:14.827 --> 20:16.172
It was his hat, Mr. Krabs.
这是他的帽子，蟹老板。

20:16.275 --> 20:18.413
He was number one!
他是第一！

20:18.517 --> 20:20.655
Ahh! Barnacles!
啊！藤壶！

20:20.758 --> 20:22.379
I'll never find...
我永远找不到...

20:25.413 --> 20:26.827
The grave!
坟墓！

20:26.931 --> 20:31.448
Am I really going to defile
this grave for money?
我真的要玷污吗
这座坟是为了钱吗？

20:31.551 --> 20:32.551
Of course I am!
我当然是！

20:35.965 --> 20:37.241
Jackpot!
大奖！

20:38.862 --> 20:42.103
Ooh. It's beautiful.
哦。很美丽。

20:42.206 --> 20:44.448
Come to Papa.
来找爸爸吧。

20:44.551 --> 20:45.275
Huh?
啊？

20:45.379 --> 20:48.068
Come on, Smitty, let go.
来吧，斯密蒂，放手。

20:48.517 --> 20:49.931
Rest in pieces, Smitty.
安息吧，斯密蒂。

20:50.034 --> 20:53.103
I got the million-dollar hat!
我拿到了价值百万美元的帽子！

20:54.896 --> 20:57.275
Hey, man, that's my hat.
嘿，伙计，那是我的帽子。

20:57.379 --> 20:58.586
Give it back.
把它还给我。

20:58.689 --> 20:59.758
What? No way.
什么？决不。

20:59.862 --> 21:03.172
Just crawl back
into your hole, bone boy.
就爬回来
进你的洞里吧，骨头男孩。

21:03.275 --> 21:04.344
Go ahead, play dead.
来吧，装死吧。

21:04.448 --> 21:06.379
I guess I'm going to have
to take it from you.
我想我将会有
从你手中夺走它。

21:06.482 --> 21:09.551
Yeah, right. You and what army?
是的，对。你和什么军队？

21:10.862 --> 21:13.068
Only the army
of the living dead.
只有军队
活死人的。

21:13.172 --> 21:15.620
Oh, no! I've seen this
on the late show.
哦，不！我见过这个
在晚间节目中。

21:15.724 --> 21:17.068
You ghoulish fiends hold me down
你们这些残忍的恶魔压制着我

21:17.172 --> 21:18.931
and take turns
nibbling on my innards.
并轮流
啃咬我的内脏。

21:19.034 --> 21:22.655
Then you eat my brain and
leave my body for the buzzards.
然后你吃掉我的大脑然后
把我的身体留给秃鹰吧。

21:22.758 --> 21:23.827
That's disgusting.
太恶心了。

21:23.931 --> 21:25.172
We just want the hat back.
我们只想拿回帽子。

21:25.275 --> 21:28.206
No flipping way!
没有翻转方式！

21:28.827 --> 21:31.034
Back up! Back up, I say!
备份！后退，我说！

21:31.137 --> 21:32.137
Attack.
攻击。

21:33.586 --> 21:34.655
Tallyho!
塔利霍！

21:34.758 --> 21:36.172
Look at me, I'm Errol Fin!
看着我，我是埃罗尔·芬！

21:36.275 --> 21:38.275
You're falling apart,
marrow brain!
你快崩溃了，
骨髓脑！

21:38.379 --> 21:40.448
You must be kidding!
你一定是在开玩笑！

21:40.551 --> 21:41.551
Back to oblivion!
回到遗忘！

21:41.655 --> 21:42.665
Hup-ho! How's your sister?
呵呵！你姐姐怎么样了？

21:42.689 --> 21:46.931
All right, boneheads,
playtime's over.
好吧，笨蛋，
游戏时间结束了。

21:47.034 --> 21:48.034
Yee-hoo!
呀呼！

21:55.517 --> 21:56.172
Wa-ha!
哇哈！

21:56.275 --> 21:57.448
A million dollars.
一百万美元。

21:57.551 --> 22:00.310
I've got a million dollars!
我有一百万美元了！

22:04.413 --> 22:05.517
Oh, there you are.
哦，你来了。

22:05.620 --> 22:06.620
Well, I got it.
嗯，我明白了。

22:06.689 --> 22:08.241
The rare novelty soda drink hat.
罕见的新奇苏打饮料帽子。

22:08.344 --> 22:12.310
Let's start the bidding
at $1 million.
让我们开始竞价吧
100万美元。

22:15.551 --> 22:16.379
Yeah, you want that all at once?
是的，你想一下子就得到这些吗？

22:16.482 --> 22:17.310
A million dollars!
一百万美元！

22:17.413 --> 22:18.413
You got to be kidding!
你一定是在开玩笑吧！

22:20.689 --> 22:22.275
Hey! The poor sap's
not kidding.
嘿！可怜的闷棍
不是开玩笑。

22:22.379 --> 22:24.275
Didn't you hear?
你没听到吗？

22:24.379 --> 22:27.137
They found a whole
warehouse full of them.
他们发现了一整
仓库里装满了它们。

22:27.241 --> 22:28.241
They're worthless!
他们一文不值！

22:29.896 --> 22:33.620
Let's give Mr. Krabs a big hand!
让我们向蟹老板先生伸出援手吧！

22:34.862 --> 22:37.344
Now, that's worth
a million dollars!
现在，这值得
一百万美元！

22:38.413 --> 22:40.275
Hey, kid, wait up!
嘿，孩子，等等！

22:40.379 --> 22:41.068
I saw him first!
我先看见他了！

22:41.172 --> 22:43.413
I'll give you $1 billion!
我给你10亿美元！

22:43.517 --> 22:47.517
Well, that's a spirit breaker.
嗯，这真是一个精神破坏者。

22:50.758 --> 22:52.758
What a baby.
真是个宝贝啊。

